%% Proposed order state machine (ADR 0005). Replaces RepairOrder + RepairTask.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Accepted: intake
  Accepted --> Diagnosis: start diagnosis
  Diagnosis --> Approval: estimate ready
  Diagnosis --> Ready: no repair needed (diagnosis-only invoice)
  Approval --> InProgress: customer approved / below threshold
  InProgress --> WaitingForParts: part missing
  WaitingForParts --> InProgress: parts arrived
  InProgress --> Ready: all work items done
  Ready --> HandedOver: paid and handed over
  Accepted --> Cancelled
  Diagnosis --> Cancelled
  Approval --> Cancelled: customer declined
  InProgress --> Cancelled
  WaitingForParts --> Cancelled
  HandedOver --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
